aerospace, petroleum, natural gas, chemical industries, ports, etc.";s:18:"market_description";s:1222:"Founded in 1988, Weihua Group is a large-scale equipment manufacturer specializing in the R&amp;D of overhead cranes, gantry cranes, port machinery, electric hoists, reducers, bulk material conveying equipment and so on. Weihua has been honored with more than 500 awards, such as “National Demonstration Enterprise of Technological Innovation”, “Key High-Tech Enterprise of National Torch Plan”, “National Recognized Enterprise Technology Center”, “National Quality Benchmark”, “National Green Factory”, “National Industrial Design Center”. Weihua has been developed 10 series of more than 200 types of lifting equipment. The main products are widely used in machinery, metallurgy, mine, power, railway, harbor, petroleum, chemical industries to serve thousands of large enterprises and national key projects, such like West-East Natural Gas Transmission, South-North Water Transfer Project, Olympic project, Hangzhou Bay Sea-Crossing Bridge Project, China National Coal, China Shenhua Energy, SINOPEC,CNPC, Shanghai Baosteel etc. They have been exported to more than 170 countries and regions,including Mexico, Brazil, Kazakhstan, Singapore, United States, Thailand, Malaysia, Australia and so on.";s:16:"cert_description";s:174:"The company and products obtain the certificates such as ISO9001, 14001, OHSAS18001, CE, EAC, CUTR, SGS, BV, etc. which clears the barriers for products entering your market.";s:6:"market";a:4:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"market_name";s:7:"Mission";s:10:"market_num";s:41:"Shape WEIHUA as a world innovation brand.";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"market_name";s:6:"Vision";s:10:"market_num";s:30:"Weihua makes the world easier.";}i:2;a:2:{s:11:"market_name";s:10:"Philosophy";s:10:"market_num";s:55:"First association we made, forever friends we shall be.";}i:3;a:2:{s:11:"market_name";s:10:"Guidelines";s:10:"market_num";s:48:"Green, Intelligence, Customization, and Network.";}}s:9:"advantage